  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to IOM South Sudan crisis response plan 2023&#x2013;2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed intervention aims to ensure safe and dignified access to accommodation and land tenure for returnees fleeing the Sudan crisis, reducing protection risks and preventing further displacement. To achieve this, IOM plans to provide rental and HLP support to vulnerable returnees in Juba and Wau.</narrative>
  </description>
